# ==========================================================================
# ALLOWLIST, not a blocklist. This repository is PUBLIC and its working tree
# is the whole ECU4413 module folder, which holds 1.9 GB of copyrighted
# readings, lecture recordings and Overleaf material. A blocklist here would
# fail silently and publish something it should not.
#
# Rule: ignore everything, then re-admit only what the book needs to build.
# Adding a file to the book means adding a "!" line here. That is deliberate.
# ==========================================================================

/*

# --- the Quarto project root -------------------------------------------
!/.gitignore
!/_quarto.yml
!/index.qmd
!/.github/

# --- everything the book needs but no topic owns ------------------------
!/book/
/book/_prep/
/book/_book/
/book/_book_STALE_pre-2026-09-10/
/book/.quarto/
/book/_freeze/
/book/site_libs/

# --- the chapters, at the project root so public URLs stay flat ---------
# (/NN-slug.html, which is what every Blackboard "Read" item links)
!/[0-9][0-9]-*.qmd
!/appendix-*.qmd
!/references.qmd
!/parts/

# book/ is re-admitted wholesale above, which means a stale chapter copy left in it
# WILL publish. It holds superseded pre-2026-09-10 duplicates of every chapter, including
# the ones withdrawn behind "Text to follow". Keep them out by path, not by hoping.
/book/*.qmd
/book/parts/
/book/.gitignore

# NOTE: topics/ is NOT re-admitted. It holds the decks, figures, recordings,
# ledgers and superseded builds, none of which belongs in a public repo.

# --- build output and intermediates, wherever they appear ---------------
_book/
.quarto/
_freeze/
site_libs/
*.bak
*.log
*.aux
*.toc
*.out
**/*.quarto_ipynb

# --- OS / editor --------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.Rproj.user

/.quarto/

# stray R artefact, not a book figure
/book/figures/Rplots.pdf
